    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a symptom. it's the reality. they're all constantly stressed or sad because of me. if i'm gone, the stress goes away. it feels like the only way i can actually be selfless is to just remove myself from the equation so they can finally be happy without me dragging them down.",
